# Tools

<!-- DOMAIN-INTRO-START -->
<!-- A short orientation for this page; task guidance belongs under Use. Kept across regeneration. -->
<!-- DOMAIN-INTRO-END -->

Every tool runs with the server's own privileges; the [security model](../../guides/security-model.md) says what that reaches.

| Group | Tool | Title | Does |
|---|---|---|---|
| Tools | [`ping`](tools.md#ping) | Ping | Check that the service is alive; returns `pong`. |
{% if include_mcp_apps_scaffold %}| Server apps | [`get_status`](server_apps.md#get_status) | `get_status` | Return server status (app-only; hidden from the LLM). |
| Server apps | [`get_info`](server_apps.md#get_info) | `get_info` | Return server info (app-only; hidden from the LLM). |
{% endif %}| Server info | [`get_server_info`](server_info.md#get_server_info) | Server Info | Report the version information of {{ project_name }}; returns `server_name`, `server_version`, `core_version` and, when configured, the upstream service's version. |
